What:           /sys/class/power_supply/battery/thermal_siop_level
Date:           October 2026
Description:
                Independent Exynos7880 AP thermal charging request. Accepts
                integer percentages from 10 to 100; 100 releases the request
                and is the initial value at boot.

                Uses the board's nominal currents and Samsung SIOP conversion,
                including its USB charging floor. The result is combined by
                minimum with the existing input and charging current limits.
                This does not change siop_level, charging enablement, battery
                temperature protection, or USB configuration restrictions.

                The request persists until another write or reboot. Userspace
                must update it after restart and write 100 when releasing it.
